  aciklama:
  - "\xC7orak ve da\u011Fl\u0131k manzaralar\u0131n fal\u0131na hakim oldu\u011Fu
    orta k\u0131s\u0131mlarda, elinde sopas\u0131 ve s\u0131rt\u0131nda ince h\u0131rkas\u0131yla
    adeta bir \"abdal\" fig\xFCr\xFC g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. D\xFCnyevi dertlerden
    ar\u0131nm\u0131\u015F, abdall\u0131k mertebesine ula\u015Fm\u0131\u015F bu insan\u0131n
    c\xFCssesi hafif olmas\u0131na ra\u011Fmen \xF6n\xFCnde uzanan g\xF6lgesi fincan\u0131n\u0131
    adeta ar\u015F\u0131nlam\u0131\u015F. Derler ki, zihnin y\xFCceli\u011Fi, g\xF6lgesinden
    anla\u015F\u0131l\u0131r. Telvelerin, \xE7ekti\u011Fi ac\u0131lar kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda
    daima metin kalabilen bir yap\u0131da oldu\u011Funu s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Metanetin
    ve m\xFCtevekkil yap\u0131n, ba\u015Flang\u0131c\u0131 {{yil_-4}}-{{yil_-1}}
    y\u0131llar\u0131 aras\u0131na uzanan ve \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki aylarda sonu\xE7lanacak
    olan zorlu bir meseleden de hay\u0131rl\u0131 \xE7\u0131kmana vesile olacak {{isim}}.\n\n\"Abdal\"
    s\xF6zc\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFCn, \xF6z\xFCnde \"bedel\" kelimesinden t\xFCredi\u011Fini
    biliyor muydun? Telvelerinin s\xF6yledi\u011Fine g\xF6re, ge\xE7mi\u015F d\xF6nemlerde
    {{kelime, \xF6nemli bir u\u011Furda | bir konuda | bir insanla ilgili}} sana
    a\u011F\u0131r gelen bedeller \xF6demi\u015Fsin. \xD6dedi\u011Fin bedelin kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    fazlas\u0131yla alacaks\u0131n {{isim}}; fal\u0131n adeta bunun g\xFCvencesini
    veriyor."
